  "releaseNotes": "Adds Trigger.Message(...), a cross-platform trigger that writes a captioned line to the run log. Prefer it over Trigger.MessageBox(...), which is Windows-only and blocks on a modal dialog - unusable headless or in CI.\nMessageBoxTrigger.Invoker is now public and settable so the dialog can be replaced in a test, and setting TESTFRAMEWORK_MESSAGEBOX=off makes it return without showing a dialog. The interactive default is unchanged.",
